.** Greet detection now = marker occurrences **beyond** the seed's own (`base = seed_text.count(marker)`; flush iff buffer count > base) â€” non-vacuous (the \"no premature flush\" test fails against the old logic). Double-paste closed by a compare-and-set under the reentrant `paths.WRITE_LOCK` (claim `paste_flushed=True` before the PTY write; loser no-ops). `pending.rstrip(\"\\r\\n\")` before write. Tests grew 8â†’11 (added no-premature-flush, newline-strip, 2-thread concurrency).\n- **GATE 2 (orchestrator-run, of record).** `python -m pytest -q` â†’ **GREEN 1083 passed, 1 skipped**. Closure verified in code (`terminal_session.py:547-575`).\n- **VERDICT: GO.** Commit scoped (terminal_session.py, session_registry.py, tests/test_pending_paste_v10.py).\n\n## Wave 2 â€” Both-artifact advance + paste-in-panel (UI) â€” âœ… GREEN (awaiting John's UI sign-off)\n\n- **EXECUTE.** `handoff.build_next_stage_prompt` (reviewable prompt, real doc paths) + `write_next_prompt` â†’ `NEXT-PROMPT.md`. `terminal_session.auto_advance_planning_to_build` (+ reconcile_and_advance + finish_to_build path) now start the next session with `paste_prompt=` (Wave-1 pending paste, UNSENT) instead of the auto-submitted seed; both artifacts written. `/api/rnd/advance_session` (researchâ†’plan) delivers the paste + records the stage edge + `_flashPendingPasteHint`. Mockup `_mockups/advance_paste.html`. New tests + Playwright `test_advance_paste_ui_v10.py`.\n- **GATE 1.** Found 3 regressions in `test_handoff_docs_v8.py` (the build-seed assertions â€” the task content correctly moved seedâ†’paste). **FIX:** relocated those 3 tests to assert the real paths + Foreman in `pending_paste` + `NEXT-PROMPT.md` (plan-cited per D6; strictly stronger, none weakened). Playwright header test was case (a) â€” header correctly shows Foreman.\n- **REVIEW (2 independent, refute).** Corroborated (â‰¥2): the Playwright POSITIVE token (`\"Crucible\"`) also appears in the echoed phase-1 seed â†’ non-discriminating; no RENDERED negative for not-auto-submitted (v4 standard gap). Plus: `finish_to_build` marks planning DONE without `kill` â†’ docs not persisted â†’ build checkout can lack the paths `NEXT-PROMPT.md` references (North-Star hole). Plus LOW: redundant \"Load the skill\" in the reviewable paste.\n- **FIX iter 1.** (1) UI test now asserts a paste-ONLY token (`research/run-1/REPORT.md`, absent from the seed) is visible in the xterm DOM + a rendered negative (cursor stays on the paste row; no submitted row below) â€” **proven non-vacuous by sabotaging `_flush_pending_paste` with `\\n` (test FAILED), then reverting**; added a non-Playwright DOM positive+negative leg. (2) `finish_to_build` now `capture_session_docs` (persist+commit to main, NO reap â€” tile stays) BEFORE advancing, so the build worktree contains the docs; new test asserts `(build_wt/impl).is_file()` + main commit. (3) `handoff.clean_paste_opener` strips the redundant load-prefix from the paste only (\"With Foreman loaded, â€¦\"); seeds unchanged; skill name + paths + read-first preserved. (Recovered from an accidental `git checkout` of terminal_session.py â€” reconstruction verified by the full gate.)\n- **GATE 2 (orchestrator-run, of record).** `python -m pytest -q` â†’ **GREEN 1094 passed, 1 skipped**.\n- **VERDICT: GO â€” committed to branch (453f687).** âœ… **John signed off on the screenshot 2026-06-17 (\"carry on\").** Wave 2 done.\n\n## Wave 3 â€” Grass workbench: two independently-toggleable terminals (UI) â€” âœ… GREEN (awaiting John's UI sign-off)\n\n- **EXECUTE.** Replaced the single shared grass `.term-host` with TWO per-lane `.gterm` hosts (research + plan), each with its own toggle (â–¾/â–¸); `toggleGrassTerminal` opens/collapses one independently; collapse hides the host but keeps the session LIVE (never kills). `develop_grass_idea` already supports one session per lane â€” no backend change. Mockup `_mockups/grass_two_terminals.html`. New DOM + Playwright tests.\n- **GATE 1.** Full suite GREEN 1099