one (3 stress runs + clean full run).\n- **VERDICT: GO â€” committed to branch (9594d89).** âœ… **John signed off (\"carry on\", standing approval).** Wave 3 done.\n\n## Wave 4 â€” Grass archive + grassâ†’project lineage back-reference â€” âœ… GREEN (awaiting John's UI sign-off)\n\n- **EXECUTE.** `effort_history.archive_grass_session` (NEW verb: persist a dev session's docs via the v8 keystone + summary ref + per-idea `archives` bundle; idea stays in grass; distinct from save_refinement/export). `session_registry.grass_origin` field; `terminal_session.start_session` stamps/inherits it; `export_grass_to_project` stamps it. UI: per-lane Archive control + \"Archived material\" list + \"from grass:\" panel chip; SAFE projection carries grass_origin (never worktree/branch); NEW token-gated `POST /api/rnd/grass_archive`. Mockup + 14 tests.\n- **GATE 1.** Full suite GREEN 1116.\n- **REVIEW (2 independent, refute) â€” CONCERNS/lean-GO.** Reviewer A: archive/security/Playwright genuinely defended; LOW â€” grass_origin inheritance is one-level-deep (chip compensates by chain-walking, fragile for a board-tile field). Reviewer B: MEDIUM â€” mockup depicts a board-TILE chip not implemented (only panel); MEDIUM â€” dead chip when origin idea deleted (inert link); MEDIUM â€” archive not idempotent (double-click duplicates). Resolved coherently toward D8 (\"every downstream session traces back\" â†’ visible on the board).\n- **FIX iter 1.** (1) grass_origin inheritance now reaches the **chain root** (bounded chain_members read) so every record carries the stamp â€” new transitive test fails pre-fix (non-vacuous). (2) Implemented the **board-tile chip** (SAFE-field stub resolved client-side; found+fixed the `\"plan\"` vs `\"planning\"` column-key bug) â€” reality now matches the mockup. (3) **Dead-chip** greyed/suppressed \"from grass (idea removed)\" with no live link (panel + tile). (4) **Idempotent archive** (content-addressed on lane+session+docs). (5) Mockup reconciled. Tests 11â†’21.\n- **FLAKE STABILIZATION (systemic â€” protects all remaining gates).** Across 3 full runs the gate flaked on a different streaming test each time (WinError 10053, then a `PytestUnhandledThreadExceptionWarning` from an SSE pump's `ValueError(\"closed file\")` escaping the loop guards). Fix: `tests/conftest.py` autouse harness â€” a `threading.excepthook` that swallows ONLY benign daemon-thread teardown exceptions (the production `_is_benign_disconnect` set + \"closed file\" ValueError + reaped-session KeyError/RuntimeError) and DELEGATES real ones; + a reap fixture for leaked servers/threads. Product: `_sse_event` normalizes the `ValueError(\"closed file\")` â†’ BrokenPipeError so existing guards catch it. No assertion/feature changed. Verified: 2 full runs (agent) + 1 orchestrator run all GREEN 1123, + streaming cluster Ã—3 with warnings escalated to hard errors â€” deterministic.\n- **GATE 2 (orchestrator-run, of record).** `python -m pytest -q` â†’ **GREEN 1123 passed, 1 skipped** (3rd consecutive clean full run).\n- **VERDICT: GO â€” committed to branch (bcbd3ca).** âœ… **John signed off (\"carry on\", standing approval).** Wave 4 done.\n\n## Wave 5 â€” Grass researchâ†’plan live handoff (within the workbench, UI) â€” âœ… GREEN (awaiting John's UI sign-off)\n\n- **EXECUTE.** `effort_history.advance_grass_research_to_plan` â€” persists the research dev docs, builds the researchâ†’plan prompt (W2), starts/focuses the CONTAINED `(idea,'plan')` dev session linked + grass_origin-stamped + paste-pending (W1); honest-negative requires a REAL persisted research doc (no fabricated handoff). UI: \"âžœ Advance to Plan\" on the research terminal bar â†’ token-gated `POST /api/rnd/grass_advance` â†’ plan terminal toggles open with the pasted-unsent prompt. Mockup + 8 tests.\n- **GATE 1.** Full suite GREEN 1131.\n- **REVIEW (2 independent, refute) â€” CONCERNS, two real defects.** (1, â‰¥2 agree, B reproduced) develop-plan-FIRST â†’ Advance silently drops the handoff: