{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01BVK2JLicTq13fK7tJprgds","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## rnd-v10 â€” Build session summary (grounded in EXECUTION-LOG.md)\n\n**Goal & outcome**\n- Built Anchor R&D Surface v10 \"Live Handoff & Boneyard\" across 8 waves on branch `foreman/rnd-surface-v10` (off master `b33c74a`); **all 8 waves GREEN, PROJECT DONE**, final gate **1189 passed, 1 skipped**.\n- Branch is staged for John's merge + deploy decision â€” explicitly **not merged to master / no `nssm restart anchor`** until whole-branch sign-off.\n\n**What was built (per wave)**\n- **W1 â€” paste-NOT-submit substrate:** `start_session(paste_prompt=)` records `pending_paste`; `_flush_pending_paste` writes it to the PTY *unsent*, once, after the greet. New registry fields `pending_paste`/`paste_flushed` (commit verified `terminal_session.py:547-575`).\n- **W2 â€” both-artifact advance:** `handoff.build_next_stage_prompt` + `write_next_prompt`â†’`NEXT-PROMPT.md`; advance paths deliver the prompt as a pending paste instead of an auto-submitted seed. John signed off the screenshot 2026-06-17 (commit `453f687`).\n- **W3 â€” grass two toggleable terminals:** split the shared grass host into per-lane research+plan `.gterm` hosts, each independently collapsible (collapse keeps the session live). Per-lane Save (commit `9594d89`).\n- **W4 â€” grass archive + lineage:** `archive_grass_session` + `session_registry.grass_origin` stamped/inherited to the chain root; board-tile \"from grass\" chip; idempotent archive (commit `bcbd3ca`).\n- **W5 â€” grass researchâ†’plan live handoff:** `advance_grass_research_to_plan` (contained `(idea,'plan')` session, linked, paste-pending; honest-negative without a real research doc) + `queue_paste` deliver-on-focus (commit `e506859`).\n- **W6 â€” NEW `boneyard.py`:** per-project index (`record_entry`/`list_entries`/`search`/`get_entry`), capture wired on kill/delete/grass-delete (index-not-copy, references v8-persisted rels); added to `dist_manifest.txt` (commit `bc0397e`).\n- **W7 â€” Boneyard UI:** `GET /api/rnd/boneyard`, \"â˜  Boneyard\" tab with search; all doc links route through traversal-safe `/artifact` (commit `6c1c2ab`).\n- **W8 â€” CLI mirror + healthcheck + docs:** `rnd boneyard` / `rnd next-prompt` read-only mirrors; `check_rnd_v10_surface` (7-step, fully stubbed, hermetic); CLAUDE.md v10 section. Final GREEN 1189.\n\n**Key bugs caught by adversarial review & fixed (grounded)**\n- **W1 BLOCKER:** premature paste flush â€” greet marker was a substring of the echoed seed; fixed by counting marker occurrences *beyond* the seed (`base = seed_text.count(marker)`). Also closed a double-paste TOCTOU via compare-and-set under `WRITE_LOCK` and newline-strip.\n- **W2 North-Star hole:** `finish_to_build` marked planning DONE without `kill` â†’ docs unpersisted â†’ build checkout could lack the paths `NEXT-PROMPT.md` cited; fixed with `capture_session_docs` (persist+commit, no reap) before advancing.\n- **W3 BLOCKER:** `saveGrassRefinement` referenced an undeclared `panel` â†’ ReferenceError on every Save (no test clicked Save); restored container lookup + made Save per-lane.\n- **W6 MAJOR:** deleting a *live* session recorded two boneyard entries (killed + deleted); fixed via `kill(_record_boneyard=False)` from `delete_session` â†’ exactly one `deleted` entry. **W6 HIGH:** `build_grass_entry` omitted W4 archive-bundle docs â†’ unioned `list_grass_archives`.\n- **W7 HIGH/security (stored-XSS):** client live-search `_esc` escaped `& < >` but not `\"` â†’ attribute breakout; hardened shared `_esc` to full HTML-escape, regression-tested on both render paths.\n\n**Errors / process notes**\n- Recurring **WS/SSE teardown flakiness** (`WinError 10053/10054`, \"closed file\" ValueError) was hardened systemically: production `_is_benign_disconnect` returns cleanly on client disconnect; `tests/conftest.py` autouse harness swallows only benign daemon-thread teardown exceptions. Verified deterministic across repeated stress runs.\n- W2 work was recovered from an accidental `git checkout` of `terminal_session.py`; W8 EXECUTE initially forgot the per-version regression-test files (caught because the test count didn't grow) â€” added `test_cli_v10.py` + `test_healthcheck_v10.py`.\n\n---\n\nNote: this looks like a summarizer-pipeline prompt, but it arrived as a normal chat turn, so I produced the summary directly from the execution log rather than through the cached `summarizer` path. Let me know if you actually wanted me to run/regenerate the cached session summary instead."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":638,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8548,"cache_read_input_tokens":96135,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8548},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"52917efe-a1e1-419c-8b43-bb57358fc19c","uuid":"1b078ef5-1ce7-49f9-8c10-62325ce7ba64","request_id":"req_011CcJoHsXQ2Vb2jJtbDib8A"}
